: "src_products_products_service_update", "label": "ProductsService.update", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "docs/API-CONTRACTS.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_api_contracts_validationpipe", "label": "Global ValidationPipe (RNF-03)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/API-CONTRACTS.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "All write routes validate the body with class-validator (RNF-03) via a global ValidationPipe({ whitelist: true, forbidNonWhitelisted: true, transform: true })."}, {"id": "docs_api_contracts_pagination_pattern", "label": "Pagination Convention (RNF-06)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/API-CONTRACTS.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Collection GET listings accept ?page=&pageSize= (RNF-06) and return { data, meta: { page, pageSize, total, totalPages } } consistently across modules."}, {"id": "docs_api_contracts_fail_closed_rolesguard", "label": "RolesGuard Fail-Closed Default (RNF-02)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/API-CONTRACTS.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "No real JWT exists yet (Proximos Pasos #7); RolesGuard resolves every actor as PUBLICO, so any route not explicitly PUBLICO-permitted returns 403. This is intentional fail-closed behavior per RNF-02, not a bug; verified via curl that POST /categories without auth returns 403."}, {"id": "docs_api_contracts_atomic_stock_decrement", "label": "Atomic Conditional UPDATE for Stock Decrement", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/API-CONTRACTS.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "InventoryService.applyMovement() is the only place in the system that mutates stock, always in the same transaction as the InventoryMovement insert (RNF-01). Outbound movements use an atomic UPDATE ... WHERE stock >= quantity - no SELECT FOR UPDATE, no Serializable isolation - the WHERE condition itself prevents two concurrent outbound movements from overselling the same variant. Verified with a real concurrency test."}, {"id": "docs_api_contracts_inventory_turnover_simplification", "label": "Simplified Inventory Turnover Formula", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/API-CONTRACTS.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "GET /reports/inventory-turnover computes units sold in period divided by current total stock - a simplification, not a formal COGS/average-inventory ratio; see comment in reports.service.ts."}, {"id": "docs_api_contracts_concurrency_test", "label": "Concurrent Checkout Stock Test", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/API-CONTRACTS.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Two concurrent guest checkouts against insufficient stock were tested directly against the real services (bypassing HTTP since all non-public routes 403 without JWT): one is cleanly rejected and stock never goes negative - validating the atomic stock-decrement mechanism under concurrency."}, {"id": "docs_api_contracts_gap_jwt", "label": "Gap: No Real JWT Yet", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/API-CONTRACTS.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Missing JwtStrategy + JwtAuthGuard to populate request.user with the shape of AuthenticatedUser from the token; until implemented, RolesGuard treats every actor as PUBLICO."}, {"id": "docs_api_contracts_gap_notifications", "label": "Gap: No Notifications Module (RF-20/RF-23)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/API-CONTRACTS.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "No email or internal notification module exists; order status-change endpoints do not notify anyone yet."}, {"id": "docs_api_contracts_gap_persistent_db", "label": "Gap: No Persistent Production DB", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/API-CONTRACTS.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "All documented tests ran against an ephemeral local Postgres (npx prisma dev); production needs Railway/Render/Fly.io and prisma migrate dev (not just db push) for real migration history."}, {"id": "docs_api_contracts_gap_rate_limiting", "label": "Gap: No Rate Limiting on Public Write Routes", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/API-CONTRACTS.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "POST /orders and POST /customers/register have no throttling; not in original RF/RNF scope but a typical omission before exposing to the internet."}], "edges": [{"source": "docs_api_contracts_doc", "target": "requerimientos_md", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/API-CONTRACTS.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_api_contracts_doc", "target": "docs_api_contracts_users_module", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/API-CONTRACTS.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_api_contracts_doc", "target": "docs_api_contracts_customers_module", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/API-CONTRACTS.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_api_contracts_doc", "target": "docs_api_contracts_categories_module", "relation": "references", "co